  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consulting services for programming and implementation of the MIP, TEIs and JES (2021-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contractor is expected to provide expert-level technical advices that strengthen the design and implementation of programs/projects financed by the EU. The EU MIP for Cambodia (2021-2027) which includes the two Team Europe Initiatives (TEIs), as well as the Joint European Strategy (JES) constitute the main framework that the services aim to support. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
